<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean coffee, effective May 15-21:</p>
<p>	 Washed arabic....................$ 222.33</p>
<p>	 Natural arabic...................$ 215.21</p>
<p>	 Robust natural...................$  68.43</p>
<p>	 Roasted and/or ground............$ 168.77</p>
</text>
